    "title": "JLo & Gwyneth Paltrow Honoured At Women In Entertainment Gala, Stars Share Powerful Insights I N18G - News18",
    "text": "JLo & Gwyneth Paltrow Honoured At Women In Entertainment Gala, Stars Share Powerful Insights I N18G\nMovies\nThe Hollywood Reporter's Women in Entertainment brunch in Beverly Hills on Wednesday brought together industry powerhouses as Jennifer Lopez received the 'Equity in Entertainment Award' and Gwyneth Paltrow was honoured with the 'Sherry Lansing Leadership Award'. Stars including Katherine LaNasa, Rhea Seehorn and Karen Pittman opened up about their latest projects and the evolving roles that keep surprising them. From LaNasa teasing big character shifts in 'The Pitt' to Seehorn reflecting on self-worth and trusting the team that believes in her, the event celebrated resilience, creativity and the women shaping Hollywood’s future.\nLast Updated: December 04, 2025, 10:55 ISTAdvertisement\nAdvertisement\nmore Videos\nFollow News18 on Google. Join the fun,\nplay games on News18. Download the\nNews18 Appto stay updated.",
